+		<<set $mara.petHouseDressed to true>>
+	<</if>>
+<</widget>>
+
+:: Mara Pet House Leave [widget]
+<<widget "maraPetHouseLeave">>
+	<<if $mara.petHouseDressed>>
+		<<storeon "maraHouse">>
+		/* If the player entered without neckwear, remove the temporary Mara collar as well. */
+		<<if $mara.petNeckWasNaked and $worn.neck.name is "leather collar">><<neckundress "wardrobe">><</if>>
+		<<set $mara.petHouseDressed to false>>
+		<<set $mara.petNeckWasNaked to false>>
+	<</if>>
+<</widget>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Reaffirm
+Mara's expression turns thoughtful. "Before we start, I want to hear you say it once more, clearly. Do you still want to be my pet? Do you accept that, while you're here with me, you'll follow my instructions?"
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Yes. I am your pet, and I will follow your commands.|Mara Pet Collar Demand]]>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[I need more time before we begin.|Mara Danube House Visit]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Collar Demand
+Mara's usual cheerful smile fades. Her posture straightens, and her voice becomes calm, firm, and unmistakably authoritative.
+<br><br>
+"Good. Then listen carefully. Take off your clothes and put on the leather collar I have prepared. Once it is fastened, get down on all fours and wait for my inspection. I won't ask you twice."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Wear the collar and obey her command|Mara Pet Collar Inspection]]>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[Stop here for today|Mara Danube House Visit]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Collar Inspection
+<<set $mara.petNeckWasNaked to ($worn.neck.name is "naked")>>
+<<undress "maraHouse">>
+<<if $worn.neck.name is "naked">><<neckwear "leather collar" "black">><</if>>
+<<set $mara.petHouseDressed to true>>
+Mara's tone leaves no room for confusion. "Everything off. I want you bare except for the collar."
+<br><br>
+<<if $worn.neck.name is "leather collar" and $worn.neck.cursed isnot 1>>
+You remove your clothes and leave them where Mara indicates. The cool leather settles around your neck, its buckle clicking shut.
+<<elseif $worn.neck.cursed is 1>>
+You remove every item you can. The collar already fastened around your neck cannot be removed, so Mara checks that it sits securely and leaves it in place.
+<<else>>
+You remove every item you can. Mara checks the collar already around your neck and leaves it in place.
+<</if>>
+<br><br>
+"Now, down on your hands and knees. Crawl over here. Slowly."
+<br><br>
+You lower yourself onto all fours and crawl across the room to her. Mara watches your posture and pace, then circles you once, checking the fit of the collar and how you respond to her instructions. She lifts your chin with two fingers and studies your expression.
+<br><br>
+"There. That's the first time you've followed my instructions as my pet. Now we are going to make the rules clear."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Listen to Mara's rules|Mara Pet Rules]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Rules
+<<set $mara.petRulesEstablished to true>>
+Mara stands in front of you, her voice still firm. "These are the rules while you are in my home. I expect you to remember every one."
+<br><br>
+1. <b>You speak only when I allow it.</b> Unless I invite you to speak, you remain quiet.
+<br><br>
+2. <b>You stay naked, with your collar on, for the entire time you are in my house.</b> Your clothes will be returned when you leave.
+<br><br>
+3. <b>You do as I tell you.</b> Follow my instructions promptly and without arguing or deliberately delaying.
+<br><br>
+4. <b>If you break a rule or disobey me, you will be punished.</b> I decide what correction is appropriate, within the boundaries we agreed to.
+<br><br>
+Mara pauses to make sure you understand. "The agreement is still something we both choose. You can pause or end it, but while you choose to take part in my home, I expect you to respect these rules. Understood?"
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Nod and accept the rules|Mara Danube Pet House]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Danube Pet House
+<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<set $bus to "danube">>
+<<maraInit>><<maraPetHousewear>>
+Mara gives your collar a brief inspection. "Good. You remember the routine. Stay close, keep quiet unless I ask you something, and wait for my instructions."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Ask Mara what she wants you to do|Mara Danube Work Intro]]>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[Leave Mara's house|Mara Danube House Leave]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Danube House Leave
+<<maraInit>><<maraPetHouseLeave>>
+<<link [[Leave Mara's house|Danube Street]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
+
